      "markdown": "# **2D Lidar Tab**\r\n\r\n## **Nodes providing data to this panel:**\r\n\r\n* Lidar Node\r\n\r\n## **Description of this tab:**\r\n\r\n* This tab display the measurements from the 2D scanning lidar sensor (which is an RPLidar C1).\r\n* The visualisation is a 2D view looking down at the car from above.\r\n* Navigate the visualization with:\r\n  * Left mouse button to pan.\r\n  * Right mouse button to rotate.\r\n  * Scroll to zoom.",
